    {
     "id": 97125,
     "resource_id": 20,
     "text": "So they set out, until when they had embarked on the ship, he [i.e., al-Khiḍr] tore it open. [Moses] said, \"Have you torn it open to drown its people? You have certainly done a grave thing.\""
    }
